    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d17">

                <pb facs="0163" n="35" xml:id="pg35"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 17.</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Francis to Mr.
                            Bayard</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-07-27"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 27,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bayard</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>Conference Saturday. He will answer soon. Take leave Friday. Lee arrived.</p>
                <closer><signed>FRANCIS</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
